    "bbox": [
      65.86,
      404.5,
      534.7,
      422.91
    ],
    "text": "and 3V2, it is seen that the Western and the Southern boundary are bounded by",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.45,
      436.91,
      534.09,
      455.32
    ],
    "text": "the railway line whilst the Eastern boundary is a public road. Therefore, it is",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.533221244812012,
      13.730775833129883,
      13.800000190734863
